
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant P as Productor Kafka
    participant K as Kafka Broker
    participant KS as Knative KafkaSource
    participant A as Knative Activator
    participant S as Knative Serving
    participant APP as Spring Boot
    participant C as Controller
    participant SV as Service

    P->>K: Publica mensaje (Key + Value)
    Note over K: Topic: cliente-knative

    KS->>K: Consume mensaje
    K-->>KS: Key + Value + Offset + Partition

    KS->>A: Envía CloudEvent HTTP
    Note over KS,A: Ce-Key, Ce-Id,<br/>Ce-Knativekafkaoffset

    A->>S: Solicita activación/enrutamiento
    S->>APP: Activa o enruta a la revisión
    APP->>C: POST /
    C->>C: Obtiene Key y Value
    C->>SV: ejecutar(payload)
    SV->>SV: Procesa el mensaje
    SV-->>APP: Finaliza procesamiento
    APP-->>KS: Respuesta HTTP 200

    Note over APP,SV: Logs de recepción y procesamiento
